# The read under the key of a for-in goes by the enumerator's index behind a test that may take the step's word. The read holds the object against the enumerator (a cell first, then its structure and order word)
# UNDER EACH OF THREE WORDS, and under no other: TestsEveryPosition (--aot-harden=ignore-told-ranges), CheckProofsAtRunTime (--aot-harden=proof-checks), EmittersAloneTestEveryPosition.
# THE LIE, testing=KeysOfForInAreTakenToBeAsTheStepFoundThem: the test takes the step's word though a call has deleted the very name. Under the lie and each word the process stops by name; under each word alone the answer is right.
# RUN(RIGHTP): run-in-shell mechanisms=all testing=CheckProofsAtRunTime
